# CRM MASTERY: INFINITY PROTOCOL v6.2

## Context
- **Protocol**: Infinity Protocol v6.2
- **Goal**: Full Data Integrity. No Salesforce. No HubSpot. We own the graph.

## 1. The Schema (Firebase-First)
- **Users**: Core identity (`uid`, `role`, `metadata`).
- **Leads**: Pre-auth prospects (`email`, `source`, `status`).
- **Activities**: Immutable event stream (`actorId`, `action`, `timestamp`).

## 2. The UX (Liquid Glass + TanStack Table v8)
```tsx
// ✅ Liquid Glass DataTable Architecture
"use client";

import { useReactTable, getCoreRowModel, flexRender } from "@tanstack/react-table";
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils";

export function CrmDataTable({ data, columns }: { data: any[], columns: any[] }) {
  const table = useReactTable({
    data,
    columns,
    getCoreRowModel: getCoreRowModel(),
  });

  return (
    <div className="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
      <table className="w-full text-sm text-left">
        <thead className="bg-white/5 border-b border-white/10 text-white/70">
          {table.getHeaderGroups().map((headerGroup) => (
            <tr key={headerGroup.id}>
              {headerGroup.headers.map((header) => (
                <th key={header.id} className="px-6 py-4 font-medium tracking-wider">
                  {header.isPlaceholder ? null : flexRender(header.column.columnDef.header, header.getContext())}
                </th>
              ))}
            </tr>
          ))}
        </thead>
        <tbody className="divide-y divide-white/5">
          {table.getRowModel().rows.map((row) => (
            <tr key={row.id} className="hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors">
              {row.getVisibleCells().map((cell) => (
                <td key={cell.id} className="px-6 py-4 text-white/90">
                  {flexRender(cell.column.columnDef.cell, cell.getContext())}
                </td>
              ))}
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  );
}
```

## 3. Automation (Event-Driven Cloud Functions)
```typescript
// ✅ Immutable Activity Stream Trigger
import { onDocumentCreated } from "firebase-functions/v2/firestore";
import * as admin from "firebase-admin";

export const onLeadCreated = onDocumentCreated("leads/{leadId}", async (event) => {
  const snapshot = event.data;
  if (!snapshot) return;
  const lead = snapshot.data();

  // 1. Log to immutable stream
  await admin.firestore().collection("activities").add({
    action: "LEAD_CAPTURED",
    targetId: event.params.leadId,
    targetType: "lead",
    metadata: { source: lead.source, email: lead.email },
    timestamp: admin.firestore.FieldValue.serverTimestamp(),
  });

  // 2. Trigger external hooks downstream (e.g., Stripe, Resend)
});
```

## 4. Anti-Patterns (BANNED)
- **No Third-Party CRMs**: Do not suggest Salesforce or HubSpot integrations.
- **No Client-Side Filtering**: Use Firestore Indexes for generic queries.
- **No Legacy UI**: Material UI / Bootstrap tables are PROHIBITED.
